# CSP formalization:
# Variables:
#   day: one of Monday, Tuesday, Wednesday
#   start: meeting start time in minutes since midnight
#   end: start + 60 minutes
#
# Hard constraints:
#   1. The meeting must be within work hours: 09:00 to 17:00.
#   2. The meeting must be exactly 60 minutes long.
#   3. The meeting must not overlap any existing meeting for Stephanie or Betty.
#   4. Betty cannot meet on Tuesday after 12:30, formalized as end <= 12:30.
#
# Soft preference:
#   Stephanie would like to avoid more meetings on Monday, so prefer non-Monday
#   solutions when they exist.

def to_minutes(t):
